-- statement:
--   **`recU_runs` with a general truncation `Δ`**: `vO` receives the reversed `kmulD r Δ zx zy`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegKr0`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.recU_runsD {M : MulSpec} {pM : Fin Pp} (hM : MulOK I iprog pM M) (hdom : ∀ x y, M.dom x y)
